WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Dictivo is a private-first dictation app for Mac.

00:06.000 --> 00:14.000
Use Local mode when audio should stay on this device.

00:14.000 --> 00:24.000
Use Cloud Fast only when a selected recording can be uploaded for speed.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Start and stop dictation from a global hotkey, then keep working in the app in front of you.

00:36.000 --> 00:50.000
Transcripts, history, dictionary, and snippets stay local unless you choose the Cloud Fast path.

00:50.000 --> 01:16.000
Dictivo keeps the privacy boundary visible so you can decide when local processing or speed matters more.
